# nexora-action-code: get_temperature
# V5 S-series releases use both the old four-column table and the later
# sensor table.  SLOT is carried from ``Slot 1`` into each sensor record.
Value Filldown SLOT (\d+(?:/\d+)?)
Value SENSOR (\S+)
Value SENSOR_ID (\d+)
Value Required TEMPERATURE (-?\d+|NA|--)
Value LOWER (-?\d+|NA|--)
Value WARNING (-?\d+|NA|--)
Value ALARM (-?\d+|NA|--)

Start
  ^\s*Slot\s+${SLOT}\s*:?[ \t]*$$
  ^\s*${SLOT}\s+${SENSOR}\s+${SENSOR_ID}\s+${TEMPERATURE}\s+${LOWER}\s+${WARNING}\s+${ALARM}(?:\s+\S+)?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${SENSOR}\s+${SENSOR_ID}\s+${TEMPERATURE}\s+${LOWER}\s+${WARNING}(?:\s+${ALARM})?(?:\s+\S+)?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${SLOT}\s+${TEMPERATURE}\s+${LOWER}\s+${WARNING}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*Slot(?:No)?\s+Temperature
  ^\s*System\s+[Tt]emperature\s+information
  ^\s*-+
  ^\s*$$
